{"title":"*Adolescence*","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/924105296/0/marginalrevolution~Adolescence.html","date":1756623977000,"content":"<p>This is a British TV show, in four episodes, available on Netflix.  It is the first TV show I have wanted to watch in about four years.  I cannot review it without immediate <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PnRzV4ehSxY\" target=\"_blank\">spoilers</a>, but I can tell you it takes place in a school, in a criminal justice system, and in a family.  Northern England, so do turn on those subtitles.  Here are <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=adolescence+tv+show+review&amp;sca_esv=a5ace5942393c46e&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=PumyaObtK8uu5NoPv9LsOQ&amp;iflsig=AOw8s4IAAAAAaLL3Toox8SmRXIFB8oX7GmDPGpmqu22V&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjmhKW8v7KPAxVLF1kFHT8pOwcQ4dUDCBo&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=adolescence+tv+show+review&amp;gs__cBsgcEMjUuMbgHtwzCBwowLjE4LjUuMi4xyAdh&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">some reviews</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/adolescence.html\">*Adolescence*</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/924105296/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/924105296/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/924105296/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/924105296/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.